P8. Switch for the correlogram veto on splits, postProcess/splitAllClusters.m:126. rez.ops.split_ccg_veto = 1: stock
(a candidate whose two halves show a correlogram dip, Q12 < 0.25 and R < 0.05, is not split). 0: the dip does not stop
the split. The field is required. rez.split_log gains two columns: 8, the dip criterion is met; 9, the new unit of a split
that was made (the other half keeps the unit of column 1), 0 if none.

diff --git a/postProcess/splitAllClusters.m b/postProcess/splitAllClusters.m
